  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"5c4f8c5c\" id=\"5c4f8c5c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87c2bb37\" id=\"u87c2bb37\">模型的保存与加载</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ubcfddc01\" id=\"ubcfddc01\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"61a3ec66\" id=\"61a3ec66\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3bb5dfe\" id=\"ua3bb5dfe\">介绍</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4eebd4a1\" id=\"u4eebd4a1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2e4da0b4\" id=\"u2e4da0b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8144e288\" id=\"u8144e288\">本实验主要讲解了在不同环境下, 如何利用PyTorch对模型进行加载的过程. 在本实验中我们将学到</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue9848b3b\" id=\"ue9848b3b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1be39883\" id=\"u1be39883\">torch.save(), torch.load() 和 torch.nn.Module().load_state_dict()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u64d9aab3\" id=\"u64d9aab3\">的作用以及他们的使用方式</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u07d94ba2\" id=\"u07d94ba2\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u36e19878\" id=\"u36e19878\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e88f748\" id=\"u5e88f748\">知识点:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u61158fed\" id=\"u61158fed\"><br></p><ul list=\"u9bc8da50\"><li fid=\"u4f66465c\" data-lake-id=\"uf89e15ba\" id=\"uf89e15ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ecece85\" id=\"u0ecece85\">完整模型的保存</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ubd7c4cff\"><li fid=\"uc78a358c\" data-lake-id=\"ucd59da7f\" id=\"ucd59da7f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5762e19c\" id=\"u5762e19c\">模型参数的保存</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u066a09f6\"><li fid=\"ua6936143\" data-lake-id=\"uc4fc287c\" id=\"uc4fc287c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f4b20c8\" id=\"u7f4b20c8\">模型的加载</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ubc61e79c\" id=\"ubc61e79c\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"5c4f8c5c-1\" id=\"5c4f8c5c-1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9279134a\" id=\"u9279134a\">模型的保存与加载</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uaf7959bf\" id=\"uaf7959bf\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u812f288f\" id=\"u812f288f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab4a00d4\" id=\"uab4a00d4\">模型训练的实质就是优化模型中的参数, 使模型损失最小的过程. 而模型保存其实也有两种方式, 一种是直接保存整个模型, 另一种就是保存模型的参数.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uea5b3873\" id=\"uea5b3873\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1e4f24d6\" id=\"u1e4f24d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa4e070c\" id=\"ufa4e070c\">接下来我们建立一个简单的全连接网络模型</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u988a624a\" id=\"u988a624a\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cnimport%20torch.nn%20as%20nn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20Model(nn.Module)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2C%20n_input_features)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20super(Model%2C%20self).__init__()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.linear%20%3D%20nn.Linear(n_input_features%2C%201)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20forward(self%2C%20x)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20y_pred%20%3D%20torch.sigmoid(self.linear(x))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20y_pred%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%B1%82%E4%B8%BA6%E4%B8%AA%E7%A5%9E%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%83%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20Model(n_input_features%3D6)%5Cnmodel%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22942cbbff%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5ae7b5f3\" id=\"u5ae7b5f3\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9a9b3884\" id=\"u9a9b3884\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2538882\" id=\"ue2538882\">假设这个模型已经训练完毕,我们得到了此时模型的参数,那么此时我们应该怎么保存该模型呢?</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc4600244\" id=\"uc4600244\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"7975302b\" id=\"7975302b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueca31726\" id=\"ueca31726\">整个模型的保存与加载</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue3c5c8d6\" id=\"ue3c5c8d6\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uff86c0a1\" id=\"uff86c0a1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua025ade8\" id=\"ua025ade8\">我们可以将整个模型直接进行保存, 使用torch.save(model, FILE)即可, 其中model为模型的变量名, FILE为想要保存保存的文件路径</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue806246b\" id=\"ue806246b\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22FILE%20%3D%20%5C%22model.pt%5C%22%5Cntorch.save(model%2C%20FILE)%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%224d8f1eef%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua9de3221\" id=\"ua9de3221\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3872167d\" id=\"u3872167d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8111364\" id=\"uf8111364\">接下来让我们使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0afe2543\" id=\"u0afe2543\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5882008\" id=\"ua5882008\">torch.load(FILE)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u39b5ae24\" id=\"u39b5ae24\">来对模型进行加载</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udd1749d0\" id=\"udd1749d0\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%AD%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E5%92%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E6%8E%A5%E5%AE%83%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%5Cnloaded_model%20%3D%20torch.load(FILE)%5Cn%23%20%E5%86%8D%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%A8%E5%81%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%EF%BC%8C%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D%5Cnloaded_model.eval()%5Cnloaded_model%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d6c325ce%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7d3fe24d\" id=\"u7d3fe24d\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufc2f4152\" id=\"ufc2f4152\"><span data-lake-id=\"u392fb906\" id=\"u392fb906\">我们可以使用model.parameters() 查看保存前后模型参数是否发生变化</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6b836183\" id=\"u6b836183\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E5%89%8D%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%9A%5C%22)%5Cnfor%20param%20in%20model.parameters()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(param)%5Cnprint(%5C%22%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%3D%5C%22)%5Cn%23%20%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%E5%90%8E%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%9A%5C%22)%5Cnfor%20param%20in%20loaded_model.parameters()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(param)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e1da6150%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua99a3143\" id=\"ua99a3143\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue206d4d5\" id=\"ue206d4d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u509f8b46\" id=\"u509f8b46\">从结果可以很清楚的看到, 从本地加载模型完全是原来模型的复制, 也就是说torch.save(model,FILE) 函数可以很完整的保存模型</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u62637928\" id=\"u62637928\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"e6c96267\" id=\"e6c96267\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubeec9c2f\" id=\"ubeec9c2f\">模型参数的保存与加载</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u33f0a6c3\" id=\"u33f0a6c3\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u91126450\" id=\"u91126450\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4dbdc442\" id=\"u4dbdc442\">由于模型除了参数之外还存在模型结构等内容, 保存整个模型的文件一般都会比只保存模型参数的文件大得多.因此, 我们在训练过程中都会选择只保存模型参数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud5cbe45d\" id=\"ud5cbe45d\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0988e22f\" id=\"u0988e22f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96267d96\" id=\"u96267d96\">我们可以使用model.state_dict()将模型参数转为字典对象,即每层网络结构的参数分开.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u985146ee\" id=\"u985146ee\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22print(model.state_dict())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c6813930%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4eda0b2b\" id=\"u4eda0b2b\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u37e3d0ab\" id=\"u37e3d0ab\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua90725ee\" id=\"ua90725ee\">模型参数的保存, 其实就是对上面这种字典对象的保存. 我们可以使用torch.save(model.state_dict(),FILE) 对模型参数进行保存</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc04cd39c\" id=\"uc04cd39c\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22FILE%20%3D%20%5C%22model.pt%5C%22%5Cntorch.save(model.state_dict()%2C%20FILE)%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%228327abf6%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"udfbe3049\" id=\"udfbe3049\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u186d2e2b\" id=\"u186d2e2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua34fb3f6\" id=\"ua34fb3f6\">由于此时我们只保存了模型的参数, 因此在加载模型时,我们需要提前指定模型的网络结构. 如果指定的网络结构和我们定义的模型参数不匹配,则会报错</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u169e0b93\" id=\"u169e0b93\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%5Cnloaded_model%20%3D%20Model(n_input_features%3D6)%5Cn%23%20%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%5Cndicts%20%3D%20torch.load(FILE)%5Cnloaded_model.load_state_dict(dicts)%5Cnprint(loaded_model.state_dict())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b7dbcf48%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u53ac4628\" id=\"u53ac4628\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"92126f9a\" id=\"92126f9a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e87e3a7\" id=\"u2e87e3a7\">GPU和CPU</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3d7d8cdc\" id=\"u3d7d8cdc\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub4797218\" id=\"ub4797218\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1cfff5e\" id=\"ue1cfff5e\">由于 GPU 和 CPU 的训练模型方式不同，因此保存下来的模型也存在不同。为此，面对不同环境下训练出来的模型，我们的加载方式也存在细微的差别。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4cc6a889\" id=\"u4cc6a889\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0e816fc0\" id=\"u0e816fc0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00cd93f4\" id=\"u00cd93f4\">由于一般的模型保存都只是保存参数，因此下面的所有代码都是以保存和加载模型参数为例。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5d91f738\" id=\"u5d91f738\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u084607e2\" id=\"u084607e2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u340681f7\" id=\"u340681f7\">如果保存模型在 GPU 上，加载模型在 CPU 上，那么我们的保存与加载的代码应该如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uae76a4d7\" id=\"uae76a4d7\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20Save%20on%20GPU%5Cndevice%20%3D%20torch.device(%5C%22cuda%5C%22)%5Cnmodel.to(device)%5Cntorch.save(model.state_dict()%2C%20PATH)%5Cn%23%20Load%20on%20CPU%5Cndevice%20%3D%20torch.device('cpu')%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20Model(*args%2C%20**kwargs)%5Cnmodel.load_state_dict(torch.load(PATH%2C%20map_location%3Ddevice))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%222cc1a174%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0ca98126\" id=\"u0ca98126\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3f6b9629\" id=\"u3f6b9629\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca952aa9\" id=\"uca952aa9\">如果模型保存在GPU上, 加载模型的GPU上,那我们保存与加载的代码如下:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u69178a55\" id=\"u69178a55\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22device%20%3D%20torch.device(%5C%22cuda%5C%22)%5Cnmodel.to(device)%5Cntorch.save(model.state_dict()%2C%20PATH)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20Model(*args%2C%20**kwargs)%5Cnmodel.load_state_dict(torch.load(PATH))%5Cnmodel.to(device)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f8939324%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u23248999\" id=\"u23248999\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud6d43da1\" id=\"ud6d43da1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8477514\" id=\"ud8477514\">如果保存模型在 CPU 上，加载模型在 GPU 上，那么我们的保存与加载的代码应该如下</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua4c31f27\" id=\"ua4c31f27\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22torch.save(model.state_dict()%2C%20PATH)%5Cndevice%20%3D%20torch.device(%5C%22cuda%5C%22)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20Model(*args%2C%20**kwargs)%5Cn%23%20%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%E5%88%B0%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AAGPU%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E4%B8%8A%5Cnmodel.load_state_dict(torch.load(PATH%2C%20map_location%3D%5C%22cuda%3A0%5C%22))%20%5Cnmodel.to(device)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a965b603%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u76a668b9\" id=\"u76a668b9\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u41c06f24\" id=\"u41c06f24\"><span data-lake-id=\"u167834cc\" id=\"u167834cc\">如果保存模型在 CPU 上，加载模型在 CPU 上，那么我们的保存与加载的代码应该如下:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u45856065\" id=\"u45856065\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22torch.save(model.state_dict()%2C%20PATH)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20Model(*args%2C%20**kwargs)%5Cnmodel.load_state_dict(torch.load(PATH))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22079b01e9%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8fda02c1\" id=\"u8fda02c1\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"5db9fd7c\" id=\"5db9fd7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31ee10ad\" id=\"u31ee10ad\">小结</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u85ca6695\" id=\"u85ca6695\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc659dd54\" id=\"uc659dd54\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26c46ba1\" id=\"u26c46ba1\">本节我们主要学习如何保存模型</span></p>",
